; OSAC demo guest DNS -- initial zone for the `full` lab.
; Installed by setup-demo-named.sh as /var/named/dynamic/full.guests.osac.test.db.
; After the first RFC 2136 update, named owns this file and its journal
; (full.guests.osac.test.db.jnl); do not edit it by hand from then on.
;
; dns-check is the static health record that configure-lab-network.py and
; check-lab-ready.sh query. It replaces the dnsmasq
; host-record=dns-check.full.guests.osac.test,192.168.160.1 line.
;
; 60-second negative TTL: resolvers on the query chain (hub CoreDNS, guest
; workers) may look up api.<order> before OSAC creates it; a short negative
; cache keeps the readiness wait fast. This matches the SOA advice in
; osac-installer/docs/dns-backend.md.
$TTL 60
$ORIGIN full.guests.osac.test.
@       IN SOA  full.guests.osac.test. hostmaster.osac.test. (
                1      ; serial (named increments it on dynamic updates)
                3600   ; refresh
                600    ; retry
                604800 ; expire
                60     ; negative cache TTL
        )
        IN NS   localhost.
dns-check IN A   192.168.160.1
